creenshot5.png", "id": "190513696167216", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001687_190513699500549_814425097474291908_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MiUpFCuLG-8Q7kNvwE-ADaF&_nc_oc=AdqfiHiYI31DTr7ZR4v2fU4K4EGoBH-vbOP55LHK0b8VAEHOCjIPQaFNRzB7Y7KTtWc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_tmVsH4uispkUW7JvPje0uhHMaHqxTMAFZGk03WcycwQ&oe=6A26DFD3"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_cover.png", "id": "1195823440879067", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974917_1195823444212400_5305135154571797175_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Tv3SbRZ0qTMQ7kNvwG6hxBo&_nc_oc=Adq_pq-1tjrzI_pVUhKnssdZwNAsnl6INi6fcvn9JcihDuNr8-Wo4ictAJQuaYcLdX0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8AKhMQ__i2QF5ymFbLTo1V2Is-LhkzntU0VDszL-DCxQ&oe=6A26E922"}, "display_name": "Ajax All Powerful: Original Edition", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ajax (Henry Winkler) is a foul-mouthed, double-crossing genie addicted to the human souls he collects in exchange for granting wishes to gullible humans. However, something is different about the seemingly-naive little girl who has rubbed his lamp this time. For one thing, she\u2019s hired a strait-laced lawyer (Chris Parnell) to negotiate her wishes, and they might have a trick or two buried in the new contract\u2019s legalese\u2026.\n\nWritten and directed by award-winning VR creator Ethan Shaftel (KAIJU CONFIDENTIAL, EXTRAVAGANZA), AJAX ALL POWERFUL is an innovative VR comedy utilizing behind-the-scenes interactive triggers to create a fluid world of changing sizes and perspectives as the story progresses from the lamp to the real world, and beyond.", "short_description": "Ajax (Henry Winkler) is a foul-mouthed genie addicted to the human souls he collects after tricking gullible masters. But something is different about the little girl who found his lamp this time: she's hire